{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415809","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415809","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1041580901:0":{"text":"흠...","source_cn":"哼……<key:dialog18>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x650EA8D21D4E9D56","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580902:0":{"text":"토란 님, 심기가 불편하십니까? 제가 해결하겠습니다.","source_cn":"陛下，是什么事惹您烦扰？属下愿意替您分忧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02C3E14ACC3480A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580903:0":{"text":"네가 도울 수 있는 일이 아니다.","source_cn":"只怕你帮不上忙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x259FB6FF0D8D26BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580904:1":{"text":"제가 무능한 탓이군요.","source_cn":"是属下无能。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x56D3BDD1842FDFB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580905:0":{"text":"네가 무능한 게 아니다. 나라를 다스리는 일이란 남의 손에 맡길 수 없는 법이지.","source_cn":"不是你无能，而是治理国家之事，无法假手他人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1973C70F12F167C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580906:0":{"text":"설령 나의 가장 충성스러운 친위대장이라고 해도 말이다.","source_cn":"即便那个人是你，我最忠诚的禁卫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB78B371CB99A1BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580907:0":{"text":"다시는 그 누구도 감히 토란 님을 배신하지 못할 것입니다. 설령 그런 자가 나타난다 해도, 제가 처리하겠습니다.","source_cn":"绝对不会再有人敢背叛您，陛下。即便真有胆大妄为的家伙，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47E70849644AC849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580908:0":{"text":"네 충심을 의심한 적은 없다, 그레줄.","source_cn":"我从不怀疑你的忠心，格瑞泽尔勒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEFA561BCC7D35757","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580909:0":{"text":"하지만 신뢰란 사치스러운 것이야. 지금 내 앞에 있는 것이 그레이브본이라 해도.","source_cn":"但信任是一件奢侈的东西。即使如今我面对的是亡灵，也一样。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD90DB83B7B4ECD7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580910:0":{"text":"산 자도 죽은 자도 권력과 욕망에 물들 수 있다. 굳이 또다시 그런 위험을 감수할 필요는 없지.","source_cn":"活人和死人都会被权利和欲望侵染，没必要再冒这个险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF89595D7ACCFED20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580911:0":{"text":"가르침, 잊지 않겠습니다.","source_cn":"属下会牢记您的教诲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x354104D9856EE6E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580912:0":{"text":"토란 님께서 제게 베풀어 주신 신뢰는 늘 가슴에 새기고 있습니다. 결코 그 믿음을 저버리지 않겠습니다.","source_cn":"陛下对我的信任，属下也一直铭记于心，永远都不会辜负。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE803F17F567BE8D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580913:0":{"text":"토란 님과 반티스를 위해 반드시 더 많은 영혼을 모아, 충성스러운 그레이브본 대군을 만들겠습니다.","source_cn":"为了陛下，为了班题斯，属下必定竭尽全力为您搜罗更多忠诚...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x198DD65D1E377A04","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580914:0":{"text":"에스페리아는 머지않아 반드시 토란 님의 손에 들어갈 것입니다!","source_cn":"伊索米亚，终有一日会成为您的囊中之物！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C11352A3EAF8036","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580915:0":{"text":"그 약속 잊지 마라.","source_cn":"记住你的许诺。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71E709825580A355","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:托安":{"text":"토란","source":"托安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:格瑞泽尔勒":{"text":"그레줄","source":"格瑞泽尔勒","status":"m